---
title: Marzipan
source: Mum
author: Edna Faith Thoukydides
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Easy
prep time: 15m
cook time: 10m
diet: Vegetarian
tags:
- vegetarian
- ingredient
- sweet
---

Put the @ground almonds{500%g}, @icing sugar{250%g} and 125g of the @caster sugar{250%g} in a bowl, and then add the @almond essence{}.

Put the other 125g of sugar in a jug with the @water{310%ml}. Bring to the boil until slightly syrupy (approximately ~{10%minutes} on high in the microwave).

Pour about half of the syrup onto the almonds and sugar mixture and stir together with a fork. You will then have to pull the mixture together with your hands. Do not work the mixture too much.

It should hold together without being too wet. If too dry, you can add a little boiling water, but be careful to add only a small amount at a time. It is easy to get the mixture too soft.